config GMK70_WB32_RGB
    bool "GMK70 native WB32 RGB strip and wired frame transport"
    depends on BOARD_GMK70_WIRED && ZMK_RGB_UNDERGLOW
    default y
    help
      B15/SPIM2 and DMAC2 channel 0 drive the 36/41 RGB-order WS2812 LEDs.
      The left renders a virtual 77-pixel strip and synchronizes complete
      peripheral frames over the existing 16-byte wired RGB transaction.

config GMK70_RGB_LOCAL_ONLY
    bool "Do not send lighting frames to an unchanged older peer"
    depends on GMK70_WB32_RGB
    help
      Development isolation for a LEFT-only update experiment. Render local
      pixels but leave the older RIGHT application and its UART traffic alone.
